<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67509" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήπω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή
		πω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> as Adv.
			<i>not yet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.431
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλὰ μήπω τοῦτο</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπεῖτε</span>) <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.90
			</span></i>: in expostulation, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τώ τι μεθίετε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.234
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				17.422
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήπω γε</span>
			<i>nay, not yet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				631
			</span></i>: folld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρίν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				961
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1409
			</span></i> (anap.): c. opt. precantis, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήπω μανείη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1278
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήπω νοῦ τοσόνδ᾽ εἴην κενή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					403
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Conj.,
				<i>lest yet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελόμην ἐπιβαινέμεν . . , μή πώ τις . .
					λάθηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.102
				</span></i>
			 (v. l.).</div>
